      'faq.q1':'Does Segue need special permissions?',
      'faq.a1':"Yes — macOS Accessibility access, so it can read Rekordbox's on-screen deck state. Segue never modifies Rekordbox itself, and it can't see anything outside Rekordbox's window.",
      'faq.q2':'What do I need to get started?',
