      'faq.a4':"Try it free for 7 days first. If you've already bought it, reach out within your first week and we'll sort out a refund.",
      'privacy.eyebrow':'Privacy',
      'privacy.h2':"What Segue does and doesn't send anywhere",
      'privacy.intro':'Segue is a small, single-purpose utility built to respect your library, not collect it.',
