      'privacy.collect_p':"Your Mac's hardware identifier — not personal, not tied to your name — is used only to enforce the one-computer license and track your 7-day trial. It's sent to our license server on activation and periodically while the app is open. Your license key is sent the same way, to verify it against Gumroad's records. If you email support, we also see whatever you write in that message.",
      'privacy.never_h':'What we never collect',
      'privacy.never_p':"Your Rekordbox library. Segue reads your exported XML file and watches Rekordbox's on-screen deck info entirely on your own Mac — none of it is ever sent anywhere. No analytics, no tracking, no usage telemetry.",
